 own='Independent portfolio analysis with AI-assisted construction and review. Proposed corporate owner roles and approvals are part of the simulation.'
 body=f'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{e(d['title'])} | Quincy Jones</title><meta name="description" content="{e(d['subtitle'])}"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/finance-cases.css"><link rel="canonical" href="https://quincy-jones-analytics.gzsxwzqv7q.chatgpt.site/{slug}"></head><body><nav><div class="wrap"><b>QUINCY JONES / FINANCE CASES</b><a href="/#finance-cases">← Portfolio</a></div></nav><main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Decision • capital • accountability</div><h1>{e(d['title'])}</h1><p class="lede">{e(d['subtitle'])}</p><p class="flag"><b>Synthetic portfolio case.</b> Recommendations and follow-up observations are simulated. They are not employer results, approved budgets, or realized savings.</p><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Decision requested</div><h2>{e(d['decision'])}</h2><p>{e(d['why'])}</p><div class="downloads"><a class="btn" href="/{slug}/{key}_Decision_Memo.pdf" download>Decision memo · PDF</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/{slug}/{key}.xlsx" download>Editable model · Excel</a></div></div><section class="panel" aria-labelledby="cases"><h2 id="cases">Compare the modeled cases</h2><label for="caseSelect">Select a case </label><select id="caseSelect">{''.join(f'<option value="{i}">{e(c["name"])}</option>' for i,c in enumerate(captures[key]))}</select><div class="kpis" aria-live="polite">{''.join('<div class="kpi"><small>'+e(l)+'</small><strong id="metric'+str(i)+'"></strong></div>' for i,l in enumerate(labels))}</div><figure>{''.join(f'<img class="chart{" active" if i==0 else ""}" id="chart{i}" src="/{slug}/case-{i+1}.svg" alt="{e(c["name"])} modeled financial results chart">' for i,c in enumerate(captures[key]))}<figcaption class="fine">Captured October 3, 2026 (UTC) from sequential recalculations of one active Excel build. This selector displays those captures; edit workbook assumptions to build a new forecast.</figcaption></figure>{table(d['rows'])}</section><div class="grid"><section class="panel"><h2>Tradeoffs and alternatives</h2><p>{e(d['tradeoffs'])}</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Conditions before approval</h2><p>{e(d['conditions'])}</p></section></div><section class="panel"><h2>Ownership and execution</h2><p>{e(own)}</p>{table([['Proposed owner','Timing from approval','Required action']]+d['actions'])}<p class="fine">All actions start as Proposed. The Excel Actions sheet records status and evidence; no completion is claimed.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Post-decision review</h2><p>Separate synthetic monitoring exercise. Frozen targets and observations are illustrative; they are not recorded company actuals.</p>{table(d['review'])}</section><section class="panel"><h2>Method and material limitations</h2><p>{e(d['methods'])}</p><p>{e(d['limits'])}</p><p class="fine">{e(d['reference'])}</p><details><summary>Inspect the Excel summary</summary><img style="width:100%" src="/{slug}/{key}-Summary.png" alt="Rendered active base-case Excel summary"></details></section><section class="panel"><h2>Forensic review and reproduction</h2><p>Independent arithmetic, exported formula caches, scenario edits, reconciliations, visual layouts, source definitions, and download consistency were checked before publication. A second LibreOffice engine reproduced 2,134 numeric base-case formula results. Desktop Microsoft Excel and real-world outcomes remain outside the verified scope.</p><div class="downloads"><a class="btn secondary" href="/finance-audit/Finance_Upgrade_Review.md">Read the project audit</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/finance-audit/Quincy_Jones_Finance_Upgrade_Review.zip" download>Full models, memos and audit package</a></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><a href="/#finance-cases">All finance cases</a> · <a href="/operating-plan">Operating plan</a> · <a href="/fleet-investment">Fleet investment</a> · <a href="/cash-working-capital">Working capital</a></div></footer><script>const cases={json.dumps(captures[key])};const keys={json.dumps(keys)};const money=new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{{style:'currency',currency:'USD',maximumFractionDigits:0}});function showCase(){{const i=Number(document.getElementById('caseSelect').value);keys.forEach((k,j)=>document.getElementById('metric'+j).textContent=money.format(cases[i][k]));cases.forEach((c,j)=>document.getElementById('chart'+j).classList.toggle('active',j===i));}}document.getElementById('caseSelect').addEventListener('change',showCase);showCase();</script></body></html>'''
